OL,3,GNEWSASection of M20 closed after crash
OL,4,Aand fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M20's eastbound
OL,7,Fcarriageway is closed following a
OL,8,Fcrash.
OL,10,FThe motorway in Kent was shut between
OL,11,FJunction eight (Lenham) and Junction
OL,12,Fnine (Ashford) on Wednesday morning due
OL,13,Fto a "collision and car fire", National
OL,14,FHighways said.
OL,16,FThe road would remain closed "for a
OL,17,Fnumber of hours" as an investigation is
OL,18,Fcarried out, they added.
OL,20,FKent Police said it was called shortly
OL,21,Fbefore 06:00 BST and that the crash had
OL,22,Finvolved one vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
